From: Forb Hidden Gems <348521123+ForbHiddenGems@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:42:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/29] F2: tamer rank dropdown and a Fill DP button for
 testing

Save tab, with Edit on: the tamer rank is picked by title (0 Cadet ..
10 Master), so it can't be set past 10. Fill DP, in battle, gives every
party Digimon that can digivolve a full DP gauge (devedit "evofill").
Dev build only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1oHeiADE8njqFxkaQnJAX
